diff --git a/releasenotes/notes/no-body-on-204-responses-5b2e0c7d9a1f3e64.yaml b/releasenotes/notes/no-body-on-204-responses-5b2e0c7d9a1f3e64.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..99288336
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/no-body-on-204-responses-5b2e0c7d9a1f3e64.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Secret metadatum deletion, project quota update and deletion, and
+    setting or removing the preferred secret store no longer send a
+    ``null`` JSON body with their ``204 No Content`` response. Proxies
+    which enforce HTTP/1.1 framing, such as Envoy, rejected these responses
+    and returned ``502 Bad Gateway`` to the client although the request had
+    been processed.
